	"FriendlyName": "Animated GIF",
	"Description": "Native animated-GIF support: decodes GIFs into a runtime-updating UTexture2DDynamic driven by real per-frame timing (delays, disposal compositing, loop count). Usable from a UMG widget, Slate, and materials/3D. Imports .gif as a UGifAsset or loads from file/memory at runtime.",
